msgid "Camofox Browser Profile & Session"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Browser tools talk to Camofox over HTTP. **Profile** holds login state; **session** is a work line under that profile.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:10
msgid ""
"Configure under Habitat settings → Advanced → **browser** / **camofox** "
"(`browser.camofox.*` in `~/.anima/config.yaml`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:11
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Active sessions"
msgid "Profile vs session"
msgstr "活跃会话"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:17
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Attribute  | Value                                                                                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Trigger    | Sleep-cycle step `deep-sleep` (after light-sleep in DAG)                                                                                              |\n"
#| "| Target     | All active semantic memory                                                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| Operations | Contradiction detection + expiry marking, split, dedup merge, pin quality review—four sequential rounds                                               |\n"
#| "| Mode       | **Incremental** (scheduled Tue–Sun): skip quiet rounds when nothing was `updated` in 24h; **Full** (scheduled Mon + manual): all rounds on full store |\n"
msgid ""
"| Concept     | Config / field                                                            | What it owns                                               |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Profile** | Camofox `userId` (`user_id`, or derived when `managed_persistence`)       | Cookies, login, local storage — “who is browsing”          |\n"
"| **Session** | Camofox `sessionKey` (`session_key`, or derived per Habitat conversation) | Tab / task line under that profile — create and adopt tabs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 属性  | 值                                                                                                |\n"
"| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 触发    | sleep-cycle 步骤 `deep-sleep`（DAG 中在 light-sleep 之后）                                             |\n"
"| 目标     | 全部 active 语义记忆                                                                           |\n"
"| 操作 | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记、拆分、去重合并、置顶维护——四轮顺序执行 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:19
msgid ""
"One profile can have many sessions. Same profile + different sessions share "
"login state but keep separate tab lines."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:21
msgid ""
"Habitat `conversationId` is only the in-process map key for the cached "
"Camofox session object; it is not Camofox’s `sessionKey` itself (often "
"derived from it)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resolution order"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:25
msgid "When a Habitat conversation first opens a Camofox session:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:29
msgid ""
"**`user_id` set** → use that profile; `session_key` if set, else `task_` + "
"conversation id prefix. Ignores `managed_persistence`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:29
msgid ""
"Else **`managed_persistence` not false** (default **true**) → stable "
"`userId` from `~/.anima/browser_auth/camofox`; `sessionKey` derived per "
"conversation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:29
msgid ""
"Else (`managed_persistence: false`) → ephemeral random `userId` — no "
"persistent profile."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/browser-camofox.md:31
msgid ""
"`session_key` alone does nothing; it only applies when `user_id` is set."
msgstr ""

